<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wellman said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wellman said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter lowered its recommendation on Wellman Inc to neutral from accumulate, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 17-7/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
